WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.888
The drone follows a planned route around obstacles toward the green target.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:13.387
The blue path is repeatedly recomputed from the current position. Yellow records the motion already completed.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.559
When the commanded target changes, the planner updates the route while respecting the surrounding obstacles.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.561
The drone approaches the new target. This is a conceptual illustration of replanning.
